  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.5948979999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Ah, if the veena were outside you could hear its music, but it is inside and we do not hear it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.845465,
      "end": 7.2655330000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "But we can become one with it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/03.mp3",
      "start": 8.599887,
      "end": 10.290498999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And how much is music worth that ends with listening?",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.645510000000002,
      "end": 14.376553
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Ultimately the musician, the veena, the music, the listener are not separate.",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.733197,
      "end": 20.240476
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Look inside, go within, and see who is waiting there for you.",
      "path": "audio/1970-138/06.mp3",
      "start": 21.822924999999998,
      "end": 26.57
    }
  ]
}
